Terrain data attribution (https://github.com/tilezen/joerd/blob/master/docs/attribution.md):
the Terrain Tiles combine USGS 3DEP/NED (public domain) and other open elevation sources,
produced by Mapzen and distributed through the AWS Open Data registry.

The upstream TerraMinusMinus configuration samples this dataset at zoom 13 (and zoom 10 below
1 m). Only this zoom-12 tile is available offline, so offline fixtures use a zoom-12 dataset
with the same parser and blend mode; live zoom-13 behaviour is covered by opt-in tests.
